{"id":459,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究心と国際交流を広げる片山の六年間","feature_description":"片山学園は富山県で初めて開校した中高一貫校として、柔軟な独自教育を掲げています。生徒の興味や意欲を尊重し、学び方を工夫しながら、在学中の特許・資格取得を支援した事例も紹介しています。英国や豪州などの提携校との交流、海外研修や短期留学、外国人教師との英会話、オールイングリッシュの対話型授業を通して、英語四技能を伸ばす六年間を目指しています。","clubs":[{"id":9069,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9070,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9071,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9072,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9073,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9074,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9075,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9076,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9077,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9078,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9079,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/sports-team/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9080,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.katayamagakuen.jp/school-life/culture-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16